    <string name="about_changelog">Changelog:
• Full-background remote server + QR code
• Remote server PIN + login page
• Configurable remote server port
• Pause all / Resume all / Retry failed buttons
• Auto retry with backoff (5s → 30s → 2m)
• Sort list (date, name, size, status)
• Parallel multi-segment downloads (configurable)
• Battery &amp; storage status on remote page
• URL history with quick search
• Photo/video gallery (app &amp; remote page)
• Per-download speed limit &amp; priority
• Stream &amp; download files via remote browser
• MD5/SHA1/SHA256 checksum verification
• Full storage detection + .part cleanup
• Crash logger ("Log error" button on remote page)</string>
